      "exercise": "242",
      "prompt": "242. 求下列等差数列$(a_n)$的第1项和公差，设：\na) $\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}a_1+a_7&=42,\\\\a_{10}-a_3&=21;\\end{aligned}\\right.$\nb) $\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}a_5+a_{11}&=-0.2,\\\\a_4+a_{10}&=2.6;\\end{aligned}\\right.$\nc) $\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}a_1+a_5&=24,\\\\a_2\\cdot a_3&=60;\\end{aligned}\\right.$\nd) $\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}a_2+a_3+a_4&=3,\\\\a_2\\cdot a_4&=-8.\\end{aligned}\\right.$",
      "figureEvidence": [],
      "grading": "ungraded",
      "source": "derived",
      "displayAnswer": "a) $2a_1+6d=42,7d=21$，所以 $a_1=12,d=3$。b) $2a_1+14d=-0.2,2a_1+12d=2.6$，所以 $d=-1.4,a_1=9.7$。c) $a_1+2d=12$，故 $a_3=12,a_2=12-d$；由 $12(12-d)=60$ 得 $d=7,a_1=-2$。d) $a_3=a_1+2d=1$，$a_2=1-d,a_4=1+d$；$(1-d)(1+d)=-8$ 得 $d=3$ 或 $d=-3$。两组解为 $(a_1,d)=(-5,3)$ 或 $(7,-3)$。",
      "parts": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
